OL,3,AA united Ireland would be 'fantastic'
OL,4,Asays Trump during Irish visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said he
OL,7,Fwould love to see a united Ireland
OL,8,Fwhile at a meeting with the Taoiseach
OL,9,F(Irish Prime Minister) during a visit
OL,10,Fin Dublin.
OL,12,FTrump is on a two-day visit to the
OL,13,Fcountry where earlier he had a courtesy
OL,14,Fcall with the Irish President Catherine
OL,15,FConnolly at the Aras an Uachtarain -
OL,16,Fthe official residence of the Irish
OL,17,Fpresident.
OL,19,FHe has been attending meetings in
OL,20,FDublin, before travelling to the Amgen
OL,21,FIrish Open golf tournament later on
OL,22,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
